| Code | Learning Area |
|------|---------------|
| c1 | Greetings & Introductions |
| c2 | Numbers |
| c3 | Classroom, Instructions & Permission |
| c4 | Colors |
| c5 | Possession (have/has got) |
| c6 | Family |
| c7 | Body, Physical Description & Shapes |
| c8 | Abilities (can/can't) |
| c9 | House & Rooms |
| c10 | Prepositions & Location |
| c11 | Feelings & Suggestions (Let's) |
| c12 | Quantity (How many / there is/are) |
| c13 | Weather |
| c14 | City, Places & Transportation |
| c15 | Likes, Dislikes, Animals & Nature |
| c16 | Daily Routines & Time |
| c17 | Countries & Nationality |
| c18 | Clothes & Seasons |
| c19 | Food & Offers |
| c20 | Jobs |
| c21 | Alphabet & Spelling |
